## Tools
- MySQL Workbench (database, queries)
- Power BI (dashboard)

## Dataset
**Global Superstore dataset, a sample retail dataset from Tableau, also available on Kaggle
**51,290 rows and 24 columns

## Process
1. Created tables and imported data in MySQL
2. Cleaned and analysed with SQL
3. Built the dashboard in Power BI

## Key Findings
💰 Total Sales: 12.64M
📈 Total Profit: 1.47M (11.62% margin)
📦 Total Orders: 25K
⚠️ Total Losses: -920K
🏆 Top Category (2014): Technology (1,616K sales, 14.54% margin)
🌍 Top Region: Central (about 2.8M)
👥 Top Segment: Consumer (about 6.5M, roughly half of sales)

